  "semantics": {
    "safety": "Only source-backed human NPC controls; does not change mutant awareness, spotting by scripted quests, guaranteed actions or difficulty reference.",
    "fog": "Fog Visibility is the fraction of clear-weather sight retained: lower = better fog concealment.",
    "rain": "Rain Noise is retained hearing range, not literal noise volume: lower = more masking (larger concealment).",
    "storm": "Thunder Noise is retained hearing range: lower = stronger storm masking."
  },
  "constraints": [
    "Source Native 0.25x tactic steps, 0.05x accuracy/awareness steps, bounded sight maximum 2.5x (200m ahead).",
    "Rain and storm values are hearing-range fractions, so reduced values indicate stronger sound masking.",
    "Every profile has different tactics and awareness decisions grounded in its survival/combat loop, not blanket enemy buffs.",
    "Medical, supply, world loot removals, quest sources, reference difficulty, and UI grammar unchanged.",
    "Preserve exact stock-only migration; user-edited and custom presets are never overwritten."
